  "post_content": "<p>(8 fotos) Recientemente, Manu Escrig Azor, concejal de Onda S&iacute; Se Puede y secretario general del c&iacute;rculo de Podemos intervino en el Palacio Municipal de Congresos de Madrid en el acto&nbsp;&#39;Ciudades por la reducci&oacute;n de t&oacute;xicos, un almuerzo con los protagonistas&#39;, organizado por Ecologistas en Acci&oacute;n y Fundaci&oacute;n Alborada, dentro del Congreso Nacional de Medio Ambiente (<a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=es&amp;q=http://www.conama2016.org/web/index.php&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1480964906234000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGH6TOd_gCXRexcPtQs1EOpTFpHUA\" href=\"http://www.conama2016.org/web/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">CONAMA 2016</a>),&nbsp;este a&ntilde;o con 150 eventos t&eacute;cnicos y m&aacute;s de 7.000 asistentes.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manuescrigconsellespanyolmediambient/clausura.jpg\" alt=\"clausura\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manuescrigconsellespanyolmediambient/conama-01.jpg\" alt=\"conama-01\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manuescrigconsellespanyolmediambient/photo_2016-12-04_20-07-44.jpg\" alt=\"photo_2016-12-04_20-07-44\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manuescrigconsellespanyolmediambient/photo_2016-12-04_20-07-50.jpg\" alt=\"photo_2016-12-04_20-07-50\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manuescrigconsellespanyolmediambient/thumbnail_fb_img_14808443892020123.jpg\" alt=\"thumbnail_fb_img_14808443892020123\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manuescrigconsellespanyolmediambient/thumbnail_fb_img_14808444234259076.jpg\" alt=\"thumbnail_fb_img_14808444234259076\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manuescrigconsellespanyolmediambient/thumbnail_img_20161129_143500.jpg\" alt=\"thumbnail_img_20161129_143500\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/manuescrigconsellespanyolmediambient/thumbnail_img_20161129_144018.jpg\" alt=\"thumbnail_img_20161129_144018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
